# Parser benchmark
# The generated source, the massif profile and its text summary are all built
# by tests/benchmark/run.sh and are not worth versioning: the generator is
# deterministic, so the .hd can be recreated byte for byte at any time.
tests/benchmark/out/
massif.out.*
callgrind.out.*
cachegrind.out.*
